PPO is a policy gradient technique which was designed to provide faster policy updates then previously developed RL algorithms such as the advantage actor–critic (A2C) or deterministic policy gradient (DPG). PPO applies the DPG structure, but updates the policy parameter θ based on a simple surrogate objective function [32].


